/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>What you can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 \u2013 5 hours of relaxed exploration, with plenty of replayable mini-games to enjoy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balloons, lots of them. Some are hidden, others are not, but they're everywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters with over-the-top personalities. Some are mean, some are nice, and some are just\u2026 interesting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charming music. We worked with the incredibly talented folks at Fablefly Music to create a soundtrack that is both playful and curious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chill collectathon with no rush and no stress. Wander around, discover things, and play however fast (or slow) you feel like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world that feels nostalgic, inspired by the games we grew up with and that familiar urge to revisit them years later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sincere game about flying around, having fun, and embracing what makes you\u2026 you. </p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Start your first day at work as an unqualified duck with a balloon and way too much confidence. Wander the Featherfall Islands, help quirky locals, and learn that \u201cwinging it\u201d might actually be a real career strategy.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/3bcb4982ee2fd38a0dbff9e7c541966a00d12948/header.jpg?t=1786545533", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "Cute", "Third Person", "Cozy", "Funny", "Parody"], "developers": "Zuko Studios", "publishers": "Zuko Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3876490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "13 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/YUFEHGidSM4", "first_see